    {
      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "intro",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "text": "This is Working Draft's audio overview of the Impeachment Trial of Vice President Sara Duterte for August 3, 2026. This is a working reference, not an official Senate record.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "overview",
      "heading": "The big picture",
      "text": "Commission on Audit auditor Roderick Wamil was the day's sole sworn witness. His direct examination focused on the Office of the Vice President's confidential-fund records for the fourth quarter of 2022, and it remained unfinished when the court stopped for the day.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00018",
          "start_seconds": 668.48,
          "clock": "00:11:08",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00929",
          "start_seconds": 15913.36,
          "clock": "04:25:13",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S01021",
          "start_seconds": 16733.41,
          "clock": "04:38:53",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The audit evidence",
      "text": "Wamil described a compliance post-audit under Joint Circular 2015-01. He testified that the Office of the Vice President's plan and initial accomplishment report did not identify the specific confidential activities for which the funds were used.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00221",
          "start_seconds": 5109.07,
          "clock": "01:25:09",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00336",
          "start_seconds": 6297.2,
          "clock": "01:44:57",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00436",
          "start_seconds": 7187.37,
          "clock": "01:59:47",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Wamil's audit conclusions",
      "text": "Wamil said a revised report listed activities, but he viewed forty million pesos in medical and food aid and ten million pesos in incentives or travel as outside the circular's allowable confidential expenses. He also said reward payments lacked documents linking them to successful information gathering or surveillance.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00519",
          "start_seconds": 8040.18,
          "clock": "02:14:00",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00520",
          "start_seconds": 8047.5,
          "clock": "02:14:07",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00521",
          "start_seconds": 8053.84,
          "clock": "02:14:13",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00534",
          "start_seconds": 8131.04,
          "clock": "02:15:31",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Roderick C. Wamil"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00536",
          "start_seconds": 8147.74,
