    {
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Important limits in the testimony",
      "text": "Wamil said identifying payment recipients was outside his audit's scope. He also had no particular observation on several selected receipts for purchases of information, because that purpose was allowed, and he lacked personal knowledge of events after the notice of suspension.",
      "citations": [
        {
