    {
      "id": "P009",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "What's next",
      "text": "The prosecution briefly began the first quarter of 2023 before the court stopped the unfinished direct examination. Cross-examination had not begun, and Wamil was ordered to return on August 4 under the same oath.",
